{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "generated", "elements": [{"id": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "type": "frame", "x": 390, "y": 210, "width": 2493.2000000000003, "height": 877, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#bbb", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0000", "roundness": null, "seed": 1802717109, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1708674557, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "System diagram"}, {"id": "agyQigoUjTPiHBz9fb6y", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -40, "width": 810.7, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0001", "roundness": null, "seed": 852540852, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 884452692, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The LLM API (Paul's SD Q1): batch strings to fixed sampling servers", "fontSize": 22, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The LLM API (Paul's SD Q1): batch strings to fixed sampling servers", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "uw7nnKH7ZwmZ9bT1OnXT", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 20, "width": 554.4000000000001, "height": 122.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0002", "roundness": null, "seed": 832415692, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1420106115, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Requirements (ask first)\n- is 100 ms independent of string length and batch size? (yes)\n- one batch per server at a time? servers cannot be added? busy = error?\n- streaming? (no)  500 ms is p50 or p99?  tiers, and may we reject?\n- client retries, idempotency key?\nA client can: send a string, get its completion in one response within\n500 ms, or a clear rejection (429 retry-after / 504).", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Requirements (ask first)\n- is 100 ms independent of string length and batch size? (yes)\n- one batch per server at a time? servers cannot be added? busy = error?\n- streaming? (no)  500 ms is p50 or p99?  tiers, and may we reject?\n- client retries, idempotency key?\nA client can: send a string, get its completion in one response within\n500 ms, or a clear rejection (429 retry-after / 504).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "NncuuyOZ789WskMHPfl5", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 168.5, "width": 700.7, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0003", "roundness": null, "seed": 1609459028, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 410793020, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Technical challenges\n- fixed capacity: the only levers are batch fill and admission\n- 100 ms fixed cost: timer = latency lever at low load, size cap = throughput lever at high\n- sync request <-> async batch: map request -> batch -> position\n- shed early, by tier, never let the queue grow\n- a server error means 'no free slot', not an exception\nAnchors: 20k req/s \u00b7 100 strings / 100 ms = 1,000 req/s per server\n-> 20 servers floor, ~26-28 with headroom \u00b7 budget 500 = ~50 wait + 100 GPU + net + reserve", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Technical challenges\n- fixed capacity: the only levers are batch fill and admission\n- 100 ms fixed cost: timer = latency lever at low load, size cap = throughput lever at high\n- sync request <-> async batch: map request -> batch -> position\n- shed early, by tier, never let the queue grow\n- a server error means 'no free slot', not an exception\nAnchors: 20k req/s \u00b7 100 strings / 100 ms = 1,000 req/s per server\n-> 20 servers floor, ~26-28 with headroom \u00b7 budget 500 = ~50 wait + 100 GPU + net + reserve", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "Prs02hmuydSq2N7mk9jd", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 334.5, "width": 562.1, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0004", "roundness": null, "seed": 1194007561, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1599447688, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Core entities\nRequest(id, tenant, tier, string, arrival_ts, deadline = +500 ms, future)\nBatch(id, server, strings[<=100], positions, dispatched_ts)\nServer(id, state free|busy|unhealthy, last_error_ts)\nTierQueue(tier, pending[], oldest_ts)\nNot entities: the token, the model version, the cache", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Core entities\nRequest(id, tenant, tier, string, arrival_ts, deadline = +500 ms, future)\nBatch(id, server, strings[<=100], positions, dispatched_ts)\nServer(id, state free|busy|unhealthy, last_error_ts)\nTierQueue(tier, pending[], oldest_ts)\nNot entities: the token, the model version, the cache", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "8EK0EXLEZbEWDogKB9iJ", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 465.5, "width": 639.1, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0005", "roundness": null, "seed": 214697319, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 886940531, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "API\nPOST /v1/complete {string, tier?} -> {completion} | 429 {retry_after} | 504\n  header Idempotency-Key (retry attaches to the existing future)\ninternal: batchstring(strings[]) -> outputs[]  (the given contract, 1..100, 100 ms)\n          dispatch(batch) -> server with a free slot \u00b7 GET /servers health", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "API\nPOST /v1/complete {string, tier?} -> {completion} | 429 {retry_after} | 504\n  header Idempotency-Key (retry attaches to the existing future)\ninternal: batchstring(strings[]) -> outputs[]  (the given contract, 1..100, 100 ms)\n          dispatch(batch) -> server with a free slot \u00b7 GET /servers health", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "W61QIIFRFomMtYuxGvls", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 579.0, "width": 562.1, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0006", "roundness": null, "seed": 1629143659, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 713703866, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What was wrong on the day (validated)\n- 'shard a 1,000-token prompt across GPUs' -> a string is one request;\n  a batch is 1..100 requests; nothing is sharded\n- 'bin pack by GPU memory' -> servers run one batch at a time; the router\n  finds a free slot; bin packing by DURATION is Paul's follow-up\n- missing: the capacity sum (20 servers) and the sync->async mapping", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What was wrong on the day (validated)\n- 'shard a 1,000-token prompt across GPUs' -> a string is one request;\n  a batch is 1..100 requests; nothing is sharded\n- 'bin pack by GPU memory' -> servers run one batch at a time; the router\n  finds a free slot; bin packing by DURATION is Paul's follow-up\n- missing: the capacity sum (20 servers) and the sync->async mapping", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "cPTmp2m3tK4q6cDZqHAR", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 104, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3f4f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0007", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 904369081, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1723496611, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "cBRots7gn82R3COOzejY"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "gIjajUhiWQ0XRvYqrxYG"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "bI92pW4zIs9lR980A61A"}], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "cBRots7gn82R3COOzejY", "type": "text", "x": 430, "y": 265.75, "width": 280, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0008", "roundness": null, "seed": 23956132, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 853012, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Clients (chatbot product)\nPOST /v1/complete {string}\nfull completion, no streaming", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "cPTmp2m3tK4q6cDZqHAR", "originalText": "Clients (chatbot product)\nPOST /v1/complete {string}\nfull completion, no streaming", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "rqr3pt38oiNV0PRb4EsD", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#dbeafe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0009", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1115371167, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1325454247, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "Xyn2VcJ7o0z4qgIuTVAV"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "gIjajUhiWQ0XRvYqrxYG"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "vFKaLY895tGO2uza0bM9"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "MtWkEzoulsByO2FmFj0a"}], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "Xyn2VcJ7o0z4qgIuTVAV", "type": "text", "x": 950, "y": 260.0, "width": 280, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0010", "roundness": null, "seed": 1327315074, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1342721706, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Gateway\nauth \u00b7 per-tier quota\nearly reject: tier queue already past\nbudget \u2192 429 retry-after", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "rqr3pt38oiNV0PRb4EsD", "originalText": "Gateway\nauth \u00b7 per-tier quota\nearly reject: tier queue already past\nbudget \u2192 429 retry-after", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "X5n1HeEDqVPaQ8Oo9Cw6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1460, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ede9fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0011", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1683447903, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1384059774, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "Mmnd1B2zUi7W7Gtopfd2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "vFKaLY895tGO2uza0bM9"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "4z9FplbYuT0yFSNwmrbN"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "PCcuC95M7jmjprH3vuD6"}], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "Mmnd1B2zUi7W7Gtopfd2", "type": "text", "x": 1470, "y": 260.0, "width": 280, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0012", "roundness": null, "seed": 1317341999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 842499691, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tier queues (corporate, personal, free)\npending with arrival_ts + deadline\ndeadline sweeper drops \u2192 504\nnever dispatch a request that will miss", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "X5n1HeEDqVPaQ8Oo9Cw6", "originalText": "Tier queues (corporate, personal, free)\npending with arrival_ts + deadline\ndeadline sweeper drops \u2192 504\nnever dispatch a request that will miss", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "hxov7AtqBPvloq4kUgWq", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1980, "y": 240, "width": 300, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0013", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1934688715, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1855871677, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "mFu31DiBjpt0tduQ0YRo"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "4z9FplbYuT0yFSNwmrbN"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "cE8WsDwoObD5UOZ7q63E"}], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "mFu31DiBjpt0tduQ0YRo", "type": "text", "x": 1990, "y": 260.0, "width": 280, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0014", "roundness": null, "seed": 764142970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1132938255, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Batcher (size or time)\nflush at 100 strings\nor oldest waited ~50 ms\npaid first, weighted pull from free", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "hxov7AtqBPvloq4kUgWq", "originalText": "Batcher (size or time)\nflush at 100 strings\nor oldest waited ~50 ms\npaid first, weighted pull from free", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "isyBtLPUOkQi7SSTA7kF", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1960, "y": 460, "width": 340, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffedd5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0015", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1527791430, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1671781682, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "EmDaxVSDtmfCE6i4U4LY"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "cE8WsDwoObD5UOZ7q63E"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "UgSaw52dy4kCqsEij8VL"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "j1PiwnCWySl1UFeCybnL"}], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "EmDaxVSDtmfCE6i4U4LY", "type": "text", "x": 1970, "y": 480.0, "width": 320, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0016", "roundness": null, "seed": 279410343, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 421133934, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790744794875, "created": 1790744794875, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Dispatcher\nfree-slot list from server ACKs\nbusy error \u2192 mark busy until next completion\nstays errored \u2192 unhealthy, re-dispatch batch", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "isyBtLPUOkQi7SSTA7kF", "originalText": "Dispatcher\nfree-slot list from server ACKs\nbusy error \u2192 mark busy until next completion\nstays errored \u2192 unhealthy, re-dispatch batch", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "bd8JowzF7ygfksOvHyrV", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1960, "y": 690, "width": 340, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "b8UncNEuydUUbPJHgJFN", "index": "a0017", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 434028028, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1397705525, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "p07DWGA9O8SNonbTLP3r"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "UgSaw52dy4kCqsEij8VL